## 📞 IF STUCK

```bash
# Nuclear option — abort merge, return to checkpoint
git merge --abort
# Working tree returns to commit 3cd16a3

# Or full reset
git reset --hard 3cd16a3
cp state.json.backup-pre-merge-* state.json

# Bot can restart safely from checkpoint state
```

